# An Obsidian vault: the notes and the vault's settings are shared; what each person's app keeps for itself is not.

# The panes, tabs and files open on each machine, and Obsidian's caches.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/workspaces.json
.obsidian/cache/
# The graph view's zoom, forces and folded panels, which change just by using it.
.obsidian/graph.json

# Notes deleted to Obsidian's own trash.
.trash/

# What the systems leave in folders.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
